commit 38e2b3c2a775bb3c4f375c0f8d23e7f735afba55
Author: KonomiTV local mods <local@konomi.tv>
Date:   Fri Nov 13 08:31:24 2026 +0900

    feat: chase playback for in-progress recordings
    
    Server:
    - Extract MetadataAnalyzer TS duration logic into shared
      app.utils.TSInformation.calculateTSFileDuration (PCR timestamps,
      zero-fill aware); MetadataAnalyzer delegates to it (no behavior change)
    - VideoStream tracks recording state + playable duration per session;
      refreshRecordingDuration() re-measures the growing TS via PCR
      (throttled 10s, 3s safety margin at the live edge, read-only)
    - getVirtualPlaylist builds/extends virtual segments up to the
      playable duration without touching built segments; while recording
      it returns an EVENT playlist with no ENDLIST, switching to
      VOD+ENDLIST when the recording completes
    - VideoStreamsRouter refreshes the duration from the freshly loaded
      program on each playlist request
    
    Client:
    - Recorded program cards for status=Recording are now openable
      (chase playback from the start) and the badge reads
      録画中・追いかけ再生
    
    Verified with a simulated growing TS file (unit test): duration
    45.5s -> 81.8s tracked, segments 5 -> 14 extended, completion flips
    to VOD+ENDLIST, completed recordings unchanged.

